title: AWS v2 NetworkELB: Statistics
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the rate of bytes processed by

 - the load balancer

 - TLS listeners

 for AWS/NetworkELB services.

 To make this check work you have to configure the related
 special agent {{Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}}.

discovery:
 One service is created if all required metrics (ProcessedBytes,
 ProcessesBytes_TLS) are given.
